There I was in the end-game with bookoo stuff as a priest (Neutral allignment)
and standing at Crom's alter. However, before offerring the amulet, I decided
to play my drum of earthquake a couple of times to see what happened. 
Needless to say, *lots* of pits opened up including ... the alter falling
into a chasm!!! When I made my way over there (tough to do since one spends 
a bit of time in the pits :-), the alter was now chaotic. I checked the other
3 alters, and they were also chaotic!

Just thought this was an interesting occurrence - perhaps should I somehow
get a HOA before sacrificing the amulet?
